+.. _issue 93: http://bitbucket.org/ned/coveragepy/issue/93/copying-a-mock-object-breaks-coverage
+.. _issue 95: https://bitbucket.org/ned/coveragepy/issue/95/run-subcommand-should-take-a-module-name
